2026-07-27T14:46:38.9306604Z [36;1m# standard flags R selects per version (e.g. -std=gnu2x for C, -std=gnu++17[0m
2026-07-27T14:46:38.9307129Z [36;1m# / -std=gnu++20 for C++); a plain "CC = ccache gcc" override would drop[0m
